{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And the men marvelled.</b> This wonder does not stand on ״וישבו לפניו הבכור כבכורתו״, for it does not say וישיבו but rather וישבו, which implies they did so on their own. Rather, it refers to what was written above: ״וישימו לו לבדו ולהם לבדם ולמצרים האוכלים אתו לבדם״, and over this matter they marvelled, saying: What is the nature of this one? He is neither Egyptian nor Hebrew, given that he eats alone."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:00.736235948Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}